
# An example's solved environment is a local artefact. Its pixi.lock is not: since 2026-10-12
# each example tracks its lock (smiles-to-3d 0.1.1, ligand-pdbqt-meeko 0.1.2), the Hub ships a
# package's lock when its source tracks one, and the Salpa app builds the environment from it, so
# an install gets the solve that was tested rather than whatever the channels hold that day.
examples/*/.pixi/
examples/**/__pycache__/
examples/**/.pytest_cache/
